│  # Final Event Plan                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                       │
│  As your Event Host and Coordinator, I have processed the feedback regarding the seating              │
│  arrangements. To resolve Alice’s valid objection regarding her proximity to Bob, I have shifted to   │
